\newpage\section{Comparison results of sym-03-02-TP6 vs Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 neg.}

The following figure shows the distribution of RRA score in the comparison sym-03-02-TP6 vs Sym-pool-1-1,Sym-pool-1-2,Sym-pool-1-3 neg., and the RRA scores of 10 genes.

<<echo=FALSE>>=
gstable=read.table('pooled_screen_1_counts_mageck.gene_summary.txt',header=T)
@
%


<<fig=TRUE,echo=FALSE,width=4.5,height=4.5>>=# 
